flowchart TD
 H[AI host + policy] --> T[Tool registry]
 H --> R[Resource registry]
 H --> P[Prompt registry]
 T --> TL[tools/list + input schemas]
 TL --> TC[tools/call]
 TC --> G[Consent + scope + domain validation]
 G --> X[Action result]
 R --> RL[resources/list]
 R --> RT[resources/templates/list]
 RL --> RR[resources/read]
 RT --> RR
 RR --> RG[Tenant + URI authorization]
 RG --> D[Read-only context]
 P --> PL[prompts/list]
 PL --> PG[prompts/get + validated arguments]
 PG --> M[Reusable messages]
 X --> C[Validate output + cache hints]
 D --> C
 M --> C
